WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.330
Two widows stand on a road out of Moab.

2
00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:07.680
The older one, Naomi, urges the
younger one to go back home,

3
00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:09.670
again and again.

4
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:13.500
Ruth refuses: thy people
shall be my people,

5
00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:16.090
and thy God my God.

6
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:20.750
Today, a person asking to become
Jewish may hear a question first:

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.240
do you not know that Jews have suffered?

8
00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.930
Judaism does not seek converts.

9
00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:30.020
So how does someone become
Jewish, and who decides?

10
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:34.060
In this mission, you'll trace the
steps set out in a famous law code,

11
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.760
the Shulchan Arukh.

12
00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.960
Then you'll compare how different
Jewish movements answer,

13
00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.760
including a debate about Jewish fathers.

14
00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:45.050
Your mission: find out how
someone becomes Jewish,

15
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.520
and who decides.
